WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Accessibility is part of the edit, not the cleanup.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Script: show captions being corrected, not just auto-generated. Check names, timing, and line breaks. Describe important visuals in speech or text. End: 'A viewer should not need perfect audio to get the point.'

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Check captions on mute before publishing.
